msgstr "Dofus, Dofus Retro and Ankama belong to <0>Ankama Games</0>. The images and videos on this site come from the <1>game</1> and stay theirs."

#: src/screens/home-screen.tsx
msgid "Dracoon, Focus Retro, Dosoft, Retro Toolbox, ROrganizer : chaque case est relevée dans le code de l’outil, pas sur sa page d’accueil."
msgstr "Dracoon, Focus Retro, Dosoft, Retro Toolbox, ROrganizer: every mark is read in the code of the tool, not on its home page."

#: src/constants/bodies.ts
msgid "Échange, groupe, guilde, message privé, défi, craft, percepteur attaqué."
msgstr "Trade, party, guild, private message, challenge, craft, Perceptor attacked."

#: src/constants/wording.ts
